  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Blueberry Frost**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Mole**: back after 55 archived shows (452 days) [4]\n- **Riches and Wonder**: back after 76 archived shows (666 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **We Were Patriots**: back after 55 archived shows (452 days); rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Calling Out Your Name**: back after 91 archived shows (895 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Here I Am, Lord**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Counting Song for Bitter Children**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2024-03-01.sbd.matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 84 min [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer states this recording has better overall sound than the other Archive version [3]\n- **tmg2024-03-01**: source not stated; 21 songs; 87 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Source identifies this song as a Rich Mullins cover, noted as unreleased [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2024-03-01.sbd.matrix**: taped by anonymous, Liz Hamilton; source: SBD-Sony M10, Schoeps CCM4-Sony M10 [1]. Also: Source uses SBD M10 and Schoeps CCM4s, processed in Vegas, Ozone, Audacity; Zoom h1 recorder captured front vocals specifically for this track [1]\n- **tmg2024-03-01**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton; source: Zoom H1 Handy Recorder [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [The Mountain Goats Grace Cathedral 03.01.2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/the-mountain-goats-grace-cathedral-03-01-2024-poster) [5]\n- Poster by SoundCloud: [The Mountain Goats Grace Cathedral March 1 2024 Poster shirt](https://soundcloud.com/tee7-days/the-mountain-goats-grace-cathedral-march-1-2024-poster-shirt) [6]",
